7.2 scale 张量形状 = ceil(N/128) x ceil(K/128)（逐条实测验证）
==============================================================================
      检查了 37,338 个 scale 张量，形状符合 ceil(N/128)xceil(K/128) 的有 37,338 个
      不符合的：0 个
      scale dtype 集合 = {'F32'}

      举例：
        layers.3.mlp.experts.0.gate_proj.weight
          权重 [2048, 4096] F8_E4M3  → scale [16, 32] = [2048/128, 4096/128] = [16, 32]
        layers.3.self_attn.q_b_proj.weight
          权重 [16384, 1536] F8_E4M3  → scale [128, 12] = [16384/128, 1536/128] = [128, 12]
        layers.0.mlp.gate_proj.weight
          权重 [12288, 4096] F8_E4M3  → scale [96, 32] = [12288/128, 4096/128] = [96, 32]
